'''Whale Digger''' (クジラベリン, ''Kujiraberin'', '''Whale Backhoe''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]].

==Effect==
"Critical" Rate UP (Sm): [[Critical Hit]] chance for all cats that have the ability is increased by 1%.

